        "original_id": "f2ff8599-8d05-50c0-976c-c09a6aaa811d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Marge Simpson, Homer Simpson, Julie Kavner, Dan Castellaneta, Margaret Groening, Matt Groening\n- Shows and Episodes: The Tracey Ullman Show, Good Night, The Simpsons 138th Episode Spectacular\n- Products: The Simpsons Season 1 DVD set\n\nFacts:\n- Marge Simpson first appeared on television in The Tracey Ullman Show short \"Good Night\" on April 19, 1987.\n- Homer Simpson first appeared on television with his family in The Tracey Ullman Show short \"Good Night\" on April 19, 1987.\n- Marge Simpson is voiced by Julie Kavner.\n- Homer Simpson is voiced by Dan Castellaneta.\n- Matt Groening named Marge Simpson after his mother Margaret Groening.\n- The Good Night short was later aired in its entirety in the episode The Simpsons 138th Episode Spectacular.\n- The Good Night short was included on The Simpsons Season 1 DVD set and is one of the few Ullman shorts released on DVD.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
